# 🐞 bug report

### Affected Package

@angular/material

### Is this a regression?

No

### Description

I have a working Angular v8 application that uses @angular/material. I tried to upgrade to 8.1.0-next.3  to verify that Ivy mode works properly:

```
"angularCompilerOptions": {
    "enableIvy": true
  }
```
But in Ivy mode I get the error message. In non-Ivy mode everything works fine.

## 🔬 Minimal Reproduction

ng build --prod

## 🔥 Exception or Error
<pre><code>
ERROR in node_modules/@angular/material/menu/typings/menu.d.ts(161,23): error TS2314: Generic type 'ɵɵBaseDef<T>' requires 1 type argument(s).
